        &TRAJECTORY  SILENT
          FORMAT DCD
            &EACH
                MD 100
            &END EACH
        &END TRAJECTORY
        &RESTART SILENT
            &EACH 
                MD 100000
            &END EACH
        &END RESTART
        &VELOCITIES OFF
        &END VELOCITIES
